cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its recordings, please cite it as below. No release has been made yet."
title: "iphone-magnetometer: FieldLab, a stock-iPhone magnetometer recorder and test platform"
abstract: >-
  Can a stock iPhone's magnetometer, with coherent processing, recover a coded or physiological magnetic
  signal below its instantaneous noise floor? FieldLab records the raw magnetometer with its timing, motion
  and quality gates, streams it to a small server, and draws what arrived. CardioMag Probe asks the cardiac
  version of the question directly.
type: software
authors:
